BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Good Cop/Rad Cop's Comedy Attic Debut!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260904T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260904T210000
UID:20260904-good-cop-rad-cop-s-comedy-attic-debut-1900
DESCRIPTION:Good Cop/Rad Cop is a high-energy musical comedy duo from Atla
 nta\, Georgia. Armed with a guitar\, a kazoo\, and a robot that does crowd
 work\, Dave Hannah and Ryan Darling sing\, scream\, and harmonize their wa
 y into every crowd with absurd\, poignant songs rooted in punk and country
 . They made their TV debut on Netflix's Star Search\, have performed at Ne
 tflix is a Joke and Moontower Comedy Festivals\, toured with Dropkick Murp
 hys\, and shared bills with Bobcat Goldthwait\, Roy Wood Jr.\, and more. E
 qual parts summer camp and barn fire in every show.
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, 123 S Walnut Street\, Bloomington\, IN
URL:https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/376166
X-SOURCE:The Comedy Attic
END:VEVENT
