BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Chloe Radcliffe Returns to The Comedy Attic
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261017T211500
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261017T231500
UID:20261017-chloe-radcliffe-returns-to-the-comedy-at-2115
DESCRIPTION:Hailing from the Midwest and proud of it\, standup and actor C
 hloe Radcliffe can be seen in Bradley Cooper’s latest film Is This Thing
  On? She was named a Just For Laughs 2025 New Face \, along with one of De
 adline’s 15 Comedians Ready To Break Out In 2025 \, and one of Vulture
 ’s Comedians You Should And Will Know . So…get to knowin’ her\, for 
 chrissakes! A daredevil cyclist in NYC\, Chloe hosts In Tandem with Chloe 
 Radcliffe \, where she interviews other comedians while they ride a tandem
  bike together. Think Comedians in Cars\, but sweatier. Chloe’s one-woma
 n show CHEAT \, about her history of infidelity\, led The New York Times
 ’ recommendations for the New York Comedy Festival. She sold out her fu
 ll-month run at the 2023 Edinburgh Fringe Festival\, with reviews calling 
 it\, “Hilarious and sharply-crafted” (Deadline)\, “Worthy of the gre
 ats like Mike Birbiglia” (Chortle)\, and “A new take on an old topic\,
  with hard-hitting punchlines” (The New York Times). Chloe is currently 
 developing CHEAT for tv. Chloe starred in Steven Soderbergh’s COMMAND Z 
 \, and was nominated for a 2024 WGA award for her writing on the series. S
 he has been seen on Comedy Central \, Don’t Tell Comedy \, and After Mid
 night with Taylor Tomlinson . She was a staff writer on The Tonight Show 
 with Jimmy Fallon \, has a comedy feature in development with Sony\, and 
 was named a TBS Comic To Watch at the New York Comedy Festival.
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, 123 S Walnut Street\, Bloomington\, IN
URL:https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/376661
X-SOURCE:The Comedy Attic
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Salty Moms Comedy Tour
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261021T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261021T210000
UID:20261021-salty-moms-comedy-tour-1900
DESCRIPTION:The Salty Mom Comedy Tour is a filter-free night out for women
  who survive on dry shampoo and controlled chaos. Featuring savage truths 
 about marriage\, motherhood\, and other things two moms with ADHD can’t 
 remember\, this show delivers the jokes you usually whisper to your friend
 s. Ditch the kids\, rally your crew\, and blow off steam with moms who get
  it. (Men are welcome\, too!) Audiences are saying “It was amazing\, I l
 aughed the whole time!” “BEST girl’s night in a long time.” “I a
 lmost pissed my pants!” Atlanta based and nationally touring headliners 
 Holly Ballantine and Amy Brown have come together to create this special e
 vent for moms\, women\, and those who love them. Come get Raw\, Real and R
 eady For Bed!
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, 123 S Walnut Street\, Bloomington\, IN
URL:https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/381587
X-SOURCE:The Comedy Attic
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Emil Wakim Films His Netflix Special.
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261022T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261022T210000
UID:20261022-emil-wakim-films-his-netflix-special-1900
DESCRIPTION:Comedian Emil Wakim inked a deal with Netflix to record his de
 but\, hour-long stand-up special. While a specific premiere date has not y
 et been announced\, he is set to film the performance at the Comedy Attic 
 in Bloomington\, Indiana- returning to the stage where he originally star
 ted his comedy career nearly a decade prior. Be part of history! Only one 
 other Netflix special has been filmed outside of a theatre and that at the
  most famous comedy venue on Earth- The Comedy Cellar in NYC. From Deadlin
 e: SNL alum Emil Wakim has inked a deal to bring his first full-length com
 edy special to Netflix . A premiere date has not yet been disclosed. Wakim
  will tape the hour in October. It’ll be executive produced by Matthew V
 aughan for Rotten Science. A stand-up comedian\, actor\, and writer\, Waki
 m made history in 2024 as the first Lebanese American to be cast in Saturd
 ay Night Live \, performing as a featured cast member during the landmark 
 Season 50\, with frequent appearances on Weekend Update . Prior to his tim
 e on the sketch series\, Wakim taped sets for Don’t Tell Comedy and Come
 dy Central Stand-Up Featuring \, with his stand-up also featured on The To
 night Show Starring Jimmy Fallon . Based in Brooklyn\, the comedian was na
 med a New Face at Just for Laughs Montreal in 2022. He’ll be seen in A24
 ’s upcoming comedy Peaked from Molly Gordon and Allie Levitan\, as we fi
 rst reported\, and is repped by UTA and Strig Artist Management.
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, 123 S Walnut Street\, Bloomington\, IN
URL:https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/373941
X-SOURCE:The Comedy Attic
END:VEVENT
